    "Simulation only. No result here was produced on real hardware.",
    "This is a second reading of existing episodes, not a new measurement.",
    "An episode is called undelivered when its terminal lateral error exceeds the 50 mm boundary fixed before any of these cohorts were read. On this workcell that distance is the bay separation, so such an episode did not mis-seat: it never left the source bay.",
